#: includes/class-settings.php:267
msgid "Panel link — the [zinn_panel_link] shortcode signs a logged-in client into their hosting."
msgstr "የፓነል አገናኝ — [zinn_panel_link] አጭር ኮድ የገቡ ደንበኞችን ወደ ማስተናገጃቸው ያስገባቸዋል።"

#: includes/class-settings.php:281
msgid "WooCommerce — provision hosting automatically when an order is paid."
msgstr "WooCommerce — ትዕዛዙ ሲከፈል አስተናጋጅ በራስ-ሰር ያዘጋጁ።"

